    title: "The Authority Gate, Made Runnable: Fail-Closed Merge Admission for Agent-Written Code",
    preview: "An advisory reviewer that relays an AI's own verdict fails open; fail-closed merge admission applies the pre-execution authority gate to the merge boundary by refusing MERGE_READY on unparseable, schema-invalid, or self-contradictory output.",
    date: "2026-06-08",
